  "current_snapshot": {
    "description": "The maxSamplesPerPool parameter, which is new for Gx6.8 ADFs, was set mistakenly to 6.\n\nThis maxSamplesPerPool parameter needs to be set to 4 for OCAv3 Gx6.8 w6.0.1 ADF, for Gx5 chip assays, meaning the workflow is for 4 reaction runs.\n\nThis parameter needs to be updated for both \"primer_profile_RNA\" and \"primer_profile_DNA\".\n\nWe should follow OCAplus combo ADF rule to exclude the maxSamplesPerPool parameters from UI downloadable json file to avoid accidental user mistake.",
    "created": "2025-01-11T02:19:42.000+0530",
    "updated": "2025-01-22T07:22:51.000+0530",
