      "text": "Verified with OCAv3 Gx6.8 w6.0.2 Combo ADF that the maxSamplePerPool parameter was updated to 4 for both \"primer_profile_RNA\" and \"primer_profile_DNA\" and the parameter was hidden from UI downloadable json file. \n1. maxSamplePerPool hidden from UI downloadable json file.\n\n\n\n\n2. maxSamplePerPool parameter was updated to 4 for both \"primer_profile_RNA\" and \"primer_profile_DNA\" in three ADFs in Database.",
